  },
  {
    "title": "A Prisoner Executed in Jiroft Prison",
    "link": "https://www.en-hrana.org/a-prisoner-executed-in-jiroft-prison/",
    "pubDate": "2026-10-07T08:20:18.000Z",
    "content": "<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"365\">According to HRANA, citing the Balochistan Human Rights Documentation Network, a prisoner was executed in Jiroft Prison at dawn today, Wednesday, October 7, 2026.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"455\">He has been identified as Abbas Anjamrooz, 28, a resident of Jiroft.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"672\">According to the report, Abbas Anjamrooz was arrested approximately five years ago on a murder charge stemming from an altercation involving a firearm and was subsequently sentenced to death by a judicial authority.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"817\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">As of the time of this report, the prisoner’s execution has not been officially announced by prison authorities or other relevant institutions.</p>\n<p>According to HRA’s Annual Report, in 2025 at least 2,063 citizens, including 61 women and 2 juvenile offenders, were executed. Of these, the sentences of 11 individuals were carried out in public. During the same period, 172 other individuals were sentenced to death.</p>",
    "snippet": "According to HRANA, citing the Balochistan Human Rights Documentation Network, a prisoner was executed in Jiroft Prison at dawn today, Wednesday, October 7, 2026.",
    "creator": ". .",
    "sourceTitle": "Hrana",
    "sheetCategory": "Human Rights + Democracy",
    "enforcedImage": null,
    "sourceDescription": "Human Rights Activists News Agency Hrana – News Agency | Human Rights Activists News Agency",
