    "title": "January 2026 Protests: Mohsen Babaeian Sentenced to Death",
    "link": "https://www.en-hrana.org/january-2026-protests-mohsen-babaeian-sentenced-to-death/",
    "pubDate": "2026-10-06T19:11:06.000Z",
    "content": "<p>Based on information received by HRANA, Mr. Babaeian was sentenced to death on the charge of “moharebeh” (enmity against God) by Branch 26 of the Tehran Revolutionary Court, presided over by Judge Iman Afshari. The ruling was communicated to Mohsen Babaeian yesterday.</p>\n<p>Mohsen Babaeian is currently being held in Greater Tehran Prison.</p>\n<p>HRANA is reviewing further details regarding his case, the date of his arrest, and the judicial proceedings against him.</p>\n<p>He was previously arrested during the January 2026 protests.</p>\n<p><strong>Background on January 2026 Protests:</strong></p>",
